软件设计师（中级）下午题六（设计模式代码填空·C++） > T6.5 建造者（B.stem:
组装电脑要按固定的步骤（先装 CPU，再装内存），但不同配置的零件不同，用建造者把「组装步骤」和「具体零件」分开。下面是用 C++ 实现的建造者模式，类图如下，代码中只有一处空缺。代码省略了 #include 和 using namespace std;。

![类图](uml/pattern-builder.svg)

```cpp
class Computer {
public:
    string cpu, memory;
    string str() { return cpu + "/" + memory; }
};

class Builder {
protected:
    Computer* computer;
public:
    Builder() { computer = new Computer(); }
    virtual void buildCpu() = 0;
    virtual void buildMemory() = 0;
    Computer* getResult() { return computer; }
    virtual ~Builder() { delete computer; }
};

class GamingBuilder : ______ Builder {
public:
    void buildCpu() { computer->cpu = "i9"; }
    void buildMemory() {
        computer->memory = "32G";
    }
};

class OfficeBuilder : public Builder {
public:
    void buildCpu() { computer->cpu = "i3"; }
    void buildMemory() {
        computer->memory = "8G";
    }
};

class Director {
    Builder* builder;
public:
    Director(Builder* b) { builder = b; }
    Computer* construct() {
        builder->buildCpu();
        builder->buildMemory();
        return builder->getResult();
    }
};
```

